Tab Snooze (MINE) — personal fork

This repository is an unofficial, personal fork of the Tab Snooze browser
extension (https://tabsnooze.com) by csandapp (the original `author` in
manifest.json).

The original extension's code and assets are copyright of their original
authors and are used under their original terms. They are NOT relicensed
by this repository's LICENSE file. This covers:

  - static/            (compiled JavaScript bundles, source maps, CSS, media)
  - fonts/, images/, sounds/
  - index.html, offscreen.html
  - manifest.json

The MIT License in LICENSE applies only to the modifications and
documentation written for this fork (for example the hand-edited fixes
listed in CHANGELOG.md, plus README.md, AGENTS.md, CHANGELOG.md and
CLAUDE.md).
